# Homework 6 - ignore transient pipeline bus files.
# These message envelopes are regenerated by `npm run pipeline` with random
# uuid filenames + timestamps (pure diff churn) and carry the sample account
# numbers/descriptions. The directory structure is kept via .gitkeep, and the
# PII-stripped shared/results/ output stays tracked.
shared/input/*.json
shared/processing/*.json
shared/output/*.json
shared/results/*.json
